WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[The steady rhythm of a printing press]
History has a pulse.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
[Paper moves through the delivery mechanism]
Printed here. Austin, Texas.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
[Finishing equipment turns]
A trade, carried forward.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
[The press rhythm continues]
The Declaration. Set in Caslon.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
Thomas Broadside Co.
Build something that lasts.
thomasbroadside.co
